     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\">I&#39;m working on a web app for ctmm package.</div><div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\">There is a beta1 version <a href=\"https://ctmm.shinyapps.io/dashboard1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ctmm.shinyapps.io/dashboard1/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457280770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37hL_PBpZDJ9FhkpdMKXrj\">hosted in cloud</a>. You can run it without installation. This beta version is feature complete in every stage, but every stage is very simple.</div><div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\">The current alpha version is <a href=\"https://github.com/ctmm-initiative/ctmm-shiny-prototype\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ctmm-initiative/ctmm-shiny-prototype&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457280770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zKq8IgLckei5jlEbPelQl\">hosted in github</a>. There are much more features in first 2 stages now, including much more visualization and interactivity. You should be able to run from github directly by following the instructions.</div><div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/7vRktLa76Ho\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://youtu.be/7vRktLa76Ho&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457280770000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38hyemOmf0iQ8Sa82dJneM\">Here is a demo I recorded to show some features of the app</a>.</div><div><br></div></div>"
